 Runic Swedish þrīR, from Old Norse þrír, from Proto-Norse ᚦᚱᛁᛃᛟᛉ (þrijoʀ) (feminine plural), from Proto-Germanic *þrīz, ultimately from Proto-Indo-European *tréyes. Compare Norwegian and Danish tre, Icelandic þrír, Faroese tríggir."},{"parola":"tälja","pos":"verb","n_etimologia":1,"categoria":"ereditato","incerta":"no","significato":"to carve (in wood)","termine_origine":"telgja","catena":[{"codice":"non","nome":"Old Norse","termine":"telgja","categoria":"ereditato"},{"codice":"gmq-pro","nome":"Proto-Norse","termine":"ᛏᚨᛚᚷᛁᛞᚨᛁ","categoria":"ereditato"},{"codice":"gem-pro","nome":"Proto-Germanic","termine":"*talgijaną","categoria":"ereditato"}],"lontana":"gem-pro","ambiti":[],"via":"","testo":"From Old Swedish tælghia, from Old Norse telgja, Proto-Norse ᛏᚨᛚᚷᛁᛞᚨᛁ (talgidai) (third-person past singular), Proto-Germanic *talgijaną."},{"parola":"ulv","pos":"noun","n_etimologia":1,"categoria":"ereditato","incerta":"no","significato":"wolf","termine_origine":"ulfr","catena":[{"codice":"non","nome":"Old Norse","termine":"ulfr","categoria":"ereditato"},{"codice":"gmq-pro","nome":"Proto-Norse","termine":"*ᚹᚢᛚᚠᚨᛉ","categoria":"ereditato"},{"codice":"gem-pro","nome":"Proto-Germanic","termine":"*wulfaz","categoria":"ereditato"},{"codice":"ine-pro","nome":"Proto-Indo-European","termine":"*wĺ̥kʷos","categoria":"ereditato"}],"lontana":"ine-pro","ambiti":[],"via":"","testo":"From Old Swedish ulver, from Old Norse ulfr, from Proto-Norse *ᚹᚢᛚᚠᚨᛉ (*wulfaʀ), from Proto-Germanic *wulfaz, from Proto-Indo-European *wĺ̥kʷos."},{"parola":"urnöt","pos":"noun","n_etimologia":1,"categoria":"ereditato","incerta":"no","significato":"aurochs, Bos primigenius (extinct European mammal)","termine_origine":"úrr","catena":[{"codice":"non","nome":"Old Norse","termine":"úrr","categoria":"ereditato"},{"codice":"gmq-pro","nome":"Proto-Norse","termine":"*ᚢᚱᛁᛉ","categoria":"ereditato"},{"codice":"gem-pro","nome":"Proto-Germanic","termine":"*ūraz","categoria":"ereditato"}],"lontana":"gem-pro","ambiti":[],"via":"","testo":"Compound of ur (“aurchochs”) + nöt (“cattle, bull”), with the prefix being the original word for the species, from younger Old Swedish ur, uhr, from Old Norse úrr, from Proto-Norse *ᚢᚱᛁᛉ (*uriʀ), from a Proto-Germanic *ūraz. The standalone form ur is archaic and no longer used standalone in practice"},{"parola":"usel","pos":"adj","n_etimologia":1,"categoria":"non_precisato","incerta":"no","significato":"terribly bad, awfully bad","termine_origine":"úsæll","catena":[{"codice":"non","nome":"Old Norse","termine":"úsæll","categoria":"non_precisato"},{"codice":"gmq-pro","nome":"Proto-Norse","termine":"*ᚢᚾᛊᚨᛚᛁᛉ","categoria":"ereditato"},{"codice":"gem-pro","nome":"Proto-Germanic","termine":"*unsēliz","categoria":"ereditato"}],"lontana":"gem-pro","ambiti":[],"via":"","testo":"From Old Swedish ūsǣl, ūsal, osæll, from Old Norse úsæll, from Proto-Norse *ᚢᚾᛊᚨᛚᛁᛉ (*unsāliz), Proto-Germanic *unsēliz, from *un- (“un-”) + *sēliz (“happy”). Equivalent to o- + säll."},{"parola":"Åke","pos":"intj","n_etimologia":1,"categoria":"non_precisato","incerta":"no","significato":"The letter \"Å\" in the Swedish spelling alphabet","termine_origine":"Áki","catena":[{"codice":"non","nome":"Old Norse","termine":"Áki","categoria":"non_precisato"},{"codice":"gmq-pro","nome":"Proto-Norse","termine":"*ᚨᚾᚢᛉ","categoria":"non_precisato"},{"codice":"gem-pro","nome":"Proto-Germanic","termine":"*anô","categoria":"non_precisato"}],"lontana":"gem-pro","ambiti":[],"via":"","testo":"From Old Norse Áki, diminutive of Proto-Norse *ᚨᚾᚢᛉ (*anuʀ, “ancestor”), from Proto-Germanic *anô (as in the first part of the name Olaf). By folk etymology sometimes associated with Swedish åka (“ride”), as in Åke-Tor, an epithet of the thunder god Thor. Formerly an eastern Danish name (in what is "},{"parola":"år","pos":"noun","n_etimologia":1,"categoria":"ereditato","incerta":"sì","motivo_incerta":"nodo incerto nell'albero","significato":"a year (time period)","termine_origine":"ár","catena":[{"codice":"non","nome":"Old Norse","termine":"ár","categoria":"ereditato"},{"codice":"gmq-pro","nome":"Proto-Norse","termine":"*ᛃᚨᚱᚨ","categoria":"ereditato"},{"codice":"gem-pro","nome":"Proto-Germanic","termine":"*jērą","categoria":"ereditato"},{"codice":"ine-pro","nome":"Proto-Indo-European","termine":"*yóh₁r̥","categoria":"non_precisato"}],"lontana":"ine-pro","ambiti":[],"via":"","testo":"From Old Swedish ār, from Old Norse ár, from Proto-Germanic *jērą, from Proto-Indo-European *yeh₁r-."}]}